439	530	574	575	the speaker	255	‘ NOW , what I want is , Facts . Teach these boys and girls nothing but Facts . Facts alone are wanted in life . Plant nothing else , and root out everything else . You can only form the minds of reasoning animals upon Facts : nothing else will ever be of any service to them . This is the principle on which I bring up my own children , and this is the principle on which I bring up these children . Stick to Facts , sir ! ’
